{"id":"level-up-2026-09-23","name":"2026-09-23 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s251","en":"Her sense of humour made the long train journey enjoyable.","zh":"她的幽默感让漫长的火车旅程变得愉快。","note":"humour · 幽默， 幽默感 · a sense of humour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s252","en":"The theatre's stone facade survived the fire almost completely intact.","zh":"火灾后，剧院的石质正立面几乎完好无损。","note":"facade · 正面； 外表 · a stone facade","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s253","en":"Volunteers will distribute leaflets outside the station tomorrow morning.","zh":"志愿者明早将在车站外分发传单。","note":"distribute · 分发， 分配， 分送； 散布， 分布； 分类， 分区 · distribute leaflets","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s254","en":"Remember to attach your application form before sending the email.","zh":"发邮件前，记得附上申请表。","note":"attach · 系， 贴； 认为有重要性； 使附属， 附加 · attach a file","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s255","en":"She studies graphic design and creates posters for local events.","zh":"她学习平面设计，并为当地活动制作海报。","note":"graphic · 文字的； 生动的， 形象的； 绘画的， 图表的 · graphic design","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s256","en":"The council hopes the new market will encourage job creation.","zh":"市政委员会希望新市场能够促进就业岗位的创造。","note":"creation · 创造； 作品 · job creation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s257","en":"The lecture traced the history of legislation protecting public parks.","zh":"讲座追溯了保护公共公园的法律的发展历史。","note":"legislation · 法律， 法规； 立法 · new legislation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s258","en":"His natural inclination is to repair things rather than replace them.","zh":"他的自然倾向是修东西，而不是换新的。","note":"inclination · 爱好； 趋势； 倾斜 · a natural inclination","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s259","en":"Organising an outdoor wedding in winter is fraught with difficulty.","zh":"冬季举办户外婚礼困难重重。","note":"fraught · 充满…的； 担心的， 烦恼的 · fraught with difficulty","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s260","en":"Fresh basil is the key ingredient in her favourite sauce.","zh":"新鲜罗勒是她最喜欢的酱汁中的关键原料。","note":"ingredient · 组成部分， 成分； 原料； 要素， 因素 · a key ingredient","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s261","en":"Everyone is welcome to participate in the neighbourhood gardening project.","zh":"欢迎所有人参与社区园艺项目。","note":"participate · 参加， 参与 · participate in an activity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s262","en":"The exhibition uses stereoscopic images to create a sense of depth.","zh":"展览利用立体图像营造纵深感。","note":"stereoscopic · 有立体视觉的； 有立体效果的；刺， 戳； 黏贴， 黏住； 卡住， 陷住 · stereoscopic vision","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s263","en":"Taking the overnight bus proved the most economical choice.","zh":"乘夜间公交车是最省钱的选择。","note":"economical · 节约的； 经济的 · an economical choice","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s264","en":"He used a soft cloth to polish his leather shoes.","zh":"他用软布擦亮了皮鞋。","note":"polish · 磨光，擦亮；使优美， · polish shoes","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s265","en":"The striped pattern creates an optical illusion of movement.","zh":"条纹图案营造出正在移动的视觉错觉。","note":"optical · 视力的； 光学的 · an optical illusion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s266","en":"Wide trousers have come back into fashion this season.","zh":"这个季节，宽松长裤又流行起来了。","note":"fashion · 方式； 流行款式； 时装 · come into fashion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s267","en":"The booking form asks whether you already have travel insurance.","zh":"预订表询问你是否已经购买了旅行保险。","note":"insurance · 保险； 保险费； 保险业 · travel insurance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s268","en":"The dancers' brilliant costumes seemed to dazzle the entire audience.","zh":"舞者绚丽的服装仿佛让全场观众眼花缭乱。","note":"dazzle · 使目眩； · dazzle an audience","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s269","en":"Fair access is the guiding principle behind the library's policy.","zh":"公平使用是图书馆政策背后的指导原则。","note":"principle · 原则， 原理； 规范， 准则； 基本信念， 信条 · a guiding principle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s270","en":"The museum has a fascinating collection of old medical instruments.","zh":"博物馆收藏了一批有趣的旧医疗器械。","note":"medical · 医学的， 医疗的； 内科的 · medical history","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s271","en":"He developed his first photographs in the school's darkroom.","zh":"他在学校暗室里冲洗了自己的第一批照片。","note":"darkroom · 暗室 · a photographic darkroom","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s272","en":"The trousers had a small tear across the left thigh.","zh":"裤子左侧大腿部位有一道小口子。","note":"thigh · 大腿 · the upper thigh","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s273","en":"Checking hundreds of handwritten entries became a tedious task.","zh":"核对数百条手写记录成了一项乏味的任务。","note":"tedious · 冗长乏味的， 单调的 · a tedious task","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s274","en":"The archive is a reliable source for local historical records.","zh":"该档案馆是获取地方历史记录的可靠来源。","note":"source · 来源， 出处； 源头， 发源地； 根源， 起源 · a reliable source","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s275","en":"The kitchen began to smell of freshly baked bread.","zh":"厨房里开始散发出新烤面包的香气。","note":"smell · 散发…的气味； 闻到， 嗅到 · smell of bread","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s276","en":"Each participant received a notebook at the beginning of the workshop.","zh":"工作坊开始时，每位参与者都领到了一本笔记本。","note":"participant · 参加者， 参与者 · a workshop participant","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s277","en":"The smaller airport handles mostly domestic flights throughout the year.","zh":"这座较小的机场全年主要承运国内航班。","note":"domestic · 本国的； 家庭的； 驯养的 · domestic flights","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s278","en":"The tutor asked us to initiate a discussion about urban housing.","zh":"导师让我们发起一次关于城市住房的讨论。","note":"initiate · 开始， 创造， 发起； 接纳， 让…加入；加入组织者 · initiate a discussion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s279","en":"The old manor now houses a museum of rural life.","zh":"这座老庄园现在是一座乡村生活博物馆。","note":"manor · 领地， 庄园 · a manor house","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s280","en":"I bought fragrance-free detergent for washing the guest room linen.","zh":"我买了无香洗衣液，用来清洗客房床品。","note":"detergent · 净化的，清洁的；清洁剂 · laundry detergent","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s281","en":"The course compares adaptations in aquatic and terrestrial animals.","zh":"这门课比较水生动物与陆生动物的适应特征。","note":"terrestrial · 陆地的， 陆生的， 陆栖的； 地球的 · terrestrial animals","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s282","en":"The new irrigation system delivers water directly to the roots.","zh":"新的灌溉系统把水直接输送到根部。","note":"irrigation · 灌溉； 冲洗 · an irrigation system","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s283","en":"We need to compile a list of equipment before departure.","zh":"出发前，我们需要编制一份设备清单。","note":"compile · 汇编； 编纂 · compile a list","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s284","en":"The missing documents raised suspicions of deliberate deception within the company.","zh":"文件丢失引发了对公司内部存在蓄意欺骗的怀疑。","note":"deception · 欺骗； 诡计 · deliberate deception","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s285","en":"Street performances contribute to the cultural vitality of the city.","zh":"街头表演增添了这座城市的文化活力。","note":"vitality · 生命力， 活力 · cultural vitality","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s286","en":"Visitors can make a donation to support the animal shelter.","zh":"游客可以捐款支持动物收容所。","note":"donation · 捐款； 捐赠 · make a donation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s287","en":"Take a few minutes to familiarise yourself with the controls.","zh":"花几分钟熟悉一下这些操控装置。","note":"familiarise · 使熟悉， 使通晓； 使家喻户晓 · familiarise oneself with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s288","en":"We planned the entire exhibition on a very limited budget.","zh":"我们用极其有限的预算策划了整个展览。","note":"budget · 做预算；预算，预算经费 · a limited budget","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s289","en":"The dark paving stones continued to radiate heat after sunset.","zh":"日落后，深色铺路石仍持续散发热量。","note":"radiate · 发光； 发热； 辐射 · radiate heat","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s290","en":"The actual cost was lower than our original estimate.","zh":"实际费用低于我们最初的估算。","note":"actual · 实际的； 真实的 · the actual cost","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s291","en":"She kept her grandmother's letters in a small wooden chest.","zh":"她把祖母的信存放在一个小木箱里。","note":"chest · 胸； 金库， 资金 · a wooden chest","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s292","en":"There are several quiet gardens on campus where students can read.","zh":"校园里有几处安静的花园，可供学生阅读。","note":"campus · 校园 · on campus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s293","en":"Our ultimate goal is to make the archive freely accessible.","zh":"我们的最终目标是让所有人都能免费查阅档案。","note":"ultimate · 最后的，最终的；根本的；最好的事物， 极品， 精华 · the ultimate goal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s294","en":"His caustic remarks made the otherwise friendly meeting uncomfortable.","zh":"他刻薄的言辞使原本友好的会议变得令人不适。","note":"caustic · 腐蚀性的； 讽刺的， 挖苦的；腐蚀剂 · a caustic remark","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s295","en":"The instructor gave a verbal explanation before demonstrating the technique.","zh":"教练先口头解释，然后演示了这项技巧。","note":"verbal · 口头的； 言辞的， 文字的， 词语的； 动词的 · a verbal explanation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s296","en":"The course helps students develop practical skills through group projects.","zh":"这门课通过小组项目帮助学生培养实践技能。","note":"develop · 发展； 生长， 形成； 开发 · develop a skill","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s297","en":"They returned to their ancestral village for the spring festival.","zh":"他们回到祖居的村庄过春节。","note":"ancestral · 祖先的； 祖传的 · an ancestral home","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s298","en":"The new cycle path connects the residential district to the station.","zh":"新的自行车道把住宅区与车站连接起来。","note":"district · 区， 地区 · a residential district","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s299","en":"The documentary shows how arboreal mammals move between treetops.","zh":"纪录片展示了树栖哺乳动物如何在树梢之间移动。","note":"arboreal · 树木的； 栖于树木的 · arboreal mammals","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:s300","en":"The review praised the team's overall performance during a difficult season.","zh":"评价称赞了团队在艰难赛季中的整体表现。","note":"overall · 全面的； 全部的 · overall performance","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:w251","en":"humour","zh":"幽默， 幽默感","note":"英 /'hjuːmə(r)/ · 美 /'hju:mə/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0251-uk-97bd5b9d7bbf.mp3","text":"humour"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0251-us-7f82c89567f8.mp3","text":"humour"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:w252","en":"facade","zh":"正面； 外表","note":"英 /fə'sɑːd/ · 美 //","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0252-uk-0afbfb795ff0.mp3","text":"facade"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0252-us-55b1b7a17c46.mp3","text":"facade"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-09-23:w253","en":"distribute","zh":"分发， 分配， 分送； 散布， 分布； 分类， 分区","note":"英 /dɪ'strɪbjuːt;'dɪstrɪbjuːt/ · 美 /dɪ'strɪbjut/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0253-uk-53c41cb0d682.mp3","text":"distribute"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubuserconte